  "category": "program",
  "description": {
    "text": "Pokémon School is Pokémon Korea's card game program for beginners. In 2016 its sessions at toy stores and other venues, starting on 2 July 2016, gave XY-era promo packs to every entrant, to players reaching five wins and to each day's top three; Pikachu 001/XY-P and Raichu 002/XY-P, and Mandibuzz BREAK 137/XY-P, Burmy 150/XY-P and Bronzor 156/XY-P, came in those packs. Today it is a free weekend class at Pokémon Korea's head office where beginners learn with 30-card Sprigatito, Fuecoco and Quaxly decks; finishing Stage 1 earns Eevee 015/M-P and a mini album, which were also the prize of the beginners' classroom at each 2026 Korean League event, starting with Season 1 on 29 and 30 November 2025."
  },
